<title>USA: Promus Hotel Board authorizes shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Promus Hotel Board authorizes shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Promus Hotel Corp said Thursday its board of directors has authorized the company to repurchase up to $150 million of its common stock for cash.</p>
<p>The company said it currently has 51.4 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said the buyback is authorized for the open market, or in negotiated or block transactions.</p>
<p>The company said it will fund the repurchase with its cash flow and its available credit lines.</p>
<p>The company said it can conduct the repurchase program until June 30, 1998.</p>
</text>
